<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-wu-of-han" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/emperor-wu-of-han.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/march-9">9 March</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Liu Che ascends the Han throne as Emperor Wu</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Liu Che became the seventh emperor of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/han-dynasty">Han dynasty</a>, known after his death as <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-wu-of-han">Emperor Wu</a>. His reign of 54 years saw long campaigns against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/xiongnu-empire">Xiongnu</a>, Han expansion into <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/central-asia">Central Asia</a> and the promotion of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/confucianism">Confucianism</a> in government.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-wu-of-han">Emperor Wu of Han</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/han-dynasty">Han Dynasty</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
